index 7c41a4fc038b37e813f362b02f91b5ae006d2864..2c63184445c8d27b9f22eb57ea4569229e95c5d4 100644
--- a/expat/Changes
+++ b/expat/Changes
@@ -17,8 +17,17 @@
 !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
 
 Release 2.8.3 XXX XXX XX XXXX
+        Security fixes:
+           #1296  CVE-2026-72522 -- Fix an out-of-bounds read and the
+                    resulting infinite loop caused by treating low
+                    surrogates (Unicode) the same as high surrogates
+                    in functions `*_toUtf16`.  Needs Expat compiled
+                    with 16bit character support (e.g. with Firefox
+                    and/or on Windows) to be affected.
+
         Special thanks to:
             City of Munich Open Source Sabbatical
+            Mozilla Security Team
 
 
 Release 2.8.2 Thu June 25 2026
